; expect 5
; A reference to `main` from inside the entry file. The definition is
; emitted as `__axiom_user_main` (the argv wrapper owns the linker's
; `main`), but every table the emitter consults still holds the
; declaration's spelling - so a recursive call missed every
; known-function arm, fell through to the parameter arm, and left the
; bare register `%main` in the IR: `check` said OK and `opt` refused,
; while `mangledFor`'s own comment claimed the rename was handled.
; docs/memory-model.md MM-EXEC-15a; fixed 2026-08-14 by asking the
; tables under the declared name (`declSpellingOf`). The unfixed
; compiler exits 4 on this file.
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (if (< 1 0) (main) 5))
